        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引言全段 [0,263] 逐句覆盖 claim 全部断言：'ARM (stylised in lowercase as arm) is a family of RISC instruction set architectures'（[0,34]）对应'RISC 指令集架构家族'；'Arm Holdings develops the instruction set architecture and licenses them to other companies'（[110,202]）对应'Arm Holdings 设计指令集并授权给其他公司'；'who build the physical devices that use the instruction set'（[203,263]）对应'由后者据此构建物理设备'。claim 无超出引文的断言，仅个别短语存在轻微意译（如 stylised 拼写），不构成内容增补。",
