    {
      "claim_id": "arm-thumb",
      "verdict": "partially_supported",
      "targets": [
        {
          "source_id": "web-computer-science-arm-instruction-sets",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-e8d2d7132c1c"
        }
      ],
      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-e8d2d7132c1c",
          "exact": "To improve compiled code density, processors since the ARM7TDMI (released in 1994) have featured the Thumb compressed instruction set, which have their own state. When in this state, the processor executes the Thumb instruction set, a compact 16-bit encoding for a subset of the ARM instruction set."
        }
      ],
      "observations": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-e8d2d7132c1c",
          "subject": "processors since the ARM7TDMI (released in 1994)",
          "predicate": "feature",
          "object": "the Thumb compressed instruction set with their own state; a compact 16-bit encoding for a subset of the ARM instruction set"
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "WIKI-001",
        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-001",
        "VAL-002"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文支撑 claim 的前两个断言：'processors since the ARM7TDMI (released in 1994) have featured the Thumb compressed instruction set, which have their own state'（[34,162]）对应'自 ARM7TDMI（1994 年发布）起具备 Thumb 压缩指令集及自有状态'；'a compact 16-bit encoding for a subset of the ARM instruction set'（[233,299]）对应'ARM 指令集子集的紧凑 16 位编码'。但 claim 中'多数 Thumb 指令直接映射到普通 ARM 指令，通过隐含部分操作数与限制可能性来节省空间'在引文中无对应文本：引文未涉及指令直接映射机制、隐含操作数或受限可能性等表述，该断言无证据支持，故为部分支持。",
